WEBVTT

00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:30.417
Something terrible.

00:10:31.502 --> 00:10:36.590
But if you used yourself as the curator,

00:10:36.632 --> 00:10:37.841
as one with intuition --

00:10:37.883 --> 00:10:40.886
think about it, yes,
put in all the data, you know?

00:10:40.928 --> 00:10:43.430
Pescatarian, the spices, all of that.

00:10:43.972 --> 00:10:47.059
I think you would come up
with something you wanted to eat too.

00:10:47.059 --> 00:10:49.478
You know? Taking all of that
into consideration.

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:52.439
It might be a catfish stew.

00:10:53.232 --> 00:10:55.359
Something really delicious,

00:10:55.359 --> 00:10:56.694
something memorable.

00:10:57.111 --> 00:11:00.906
Now there's probably going to be
one person in there who hates it.